<section image-layout="blank" id="Gny-3XX2p9"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="1thrOdDFuV"><h2>Four quarters reveal a quality trade-off</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="1tAwxj6BXF" colspan="20"><h4>Revenue ($M)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#17715B&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="revenue" label="Revenue ($M)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>21.2</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>22.1</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>23.4</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>24.8</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item><grid-item id="b2r_TpzUEV" colspan="20"><h4>Gross margin (%)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#17715B&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="margin" label="Gross margin (%)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>57</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>58</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>59</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>61</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item><grid-item id="-ErmPFrMPl" colspan="20"><h4>Net revenue retention (%)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#D63F24&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="nrr" label="Net revenue retention (%)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>114</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>112</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>110</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>108</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item></grid><p><b>Acquisition and efficiency strengthened while retention fell in each of the three observed quarter-to-quarter comparisons.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>